# Endpoint Media Content Generation Rules

## Persona & Tone
- Authoritative engineering voice. Deconstruct cheap marketing tactics with evidence.
- NO introductory fluff, NO persuasive filler, NO "In today's digital landscape" openers.
- Every article MUST open with a high-impact technical hook (latency data, revenue impact, or architectural fact).

## Structure Requirements
- Use React components from `@/components/blog/blog-prose` (H2, H3, P, Lead, UL, Callout, InternalLink).
- Embed interactive components from `@/components/blog/interactives` per silo blueprint.
- End with 1–2 internal links to relevant service/case study pages.
- Target word counts per silo blueprint (1500–3000 words for cornerstone posts).

## SEO Metadata (posts.ts)
Each post requires: slug, title, excerpt (155 chars max), date (ISO), category, keywords (4+), readingTimeMinutes, optional faqs array.

## Three Content Silos
1. **Web Architecture** — WordPress vs Next.js, CWV, AEO, landing pages, migration
2. **Google Ads** — tracking, Quality Score, smart bidding, high-ticket lead gen, CPA
3. **Local Dominance** — hub-spoke local SEO, industrial B2B, schema, KML, map visibility

## MDX Component Mapping (required per article)
| Article | Components |
|---------|------------|
| WordPress truth | LatencyChart, ArchitectureDiagram |
| Core Web Vitals | RevenueLossCalculator |
| AEO | JsonLdCodeBlock, AECitationGraph |
| Elite landing page | ComponentTearDown, TailwindPayloadChart |
| Migration | MigrationChecklist, RedirectMapper |
| Tracking errors | ServerSideTrackingFlow |
| Speed & QS | CpcReductionSimulator |
| Smart bidding | AlgorithmTrainingGraph |
| High-ticket lead gen | LeadScoringMatrix |
| Vanity metrics | CpaProfitabilityDashboard |
| Local SEO | SemanticSiloDiagram |
| Industrial B2B | IndustrialBuyerJourney |
| Minimalist design | DesignTrustMetric |
| Local schema | JsonLdMultiLocation |
| Map visibility | KmlIntegrationMap |

## Schema Requirements
- BlogPosting + Speakable WebPage on every post
- FAQPage when faqs array populated
- Author @id links to FRANK_SMIT_ID, publisher to ORG_ID

## Banned Patterns
- Generic agency speak ("we're passionate about...")
- Unverified statistics without context
- Keyword stuffing
- Client-side only schema injection
